---
description: Project architecture — stack, URLs, static generation, what not to add
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/INFORMATION-ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- Content lives in `content/`, not a CMS or database.
- Do not add Starlight, React, MDX, Tailwind, view transitions, or a client router.
- Do not render a site-wide navigation tree.
- Trailing slashes always. Article pages must not require JavaScript.
